{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000010784","bookName":"La ira de los cuatro herederos (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000010784/42000010784.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":2518754,"followCount":45532,"introduction":"Héctor Montes, leyenda empresarial de la República de Auria, adopta a los cuatro hijos de héroes caídos tras una inundación. Retirado al campo, cuida la tumba de sus camarada. Cuando la empresa de su hija Valeria sale a bolsa, la ambiciosa familia de su prometido, Bruno Blanco, arrasa la tumba, agrede a Héctor y lo acusa falsamente. Valeria y sus tres hermanos, ahora poderosos, vengan la humillación. Exponen los crímenes de los Blanco y defienden el honor de su padre.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Family Bonds","Modern"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Modern"],"typeTwoIds":[303],"typeTwoNames":["Urbano"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":303,"name":"Urbano","replaceName":"urbano"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Urbano","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-ira-de-los-cuatro-herederos-Doblado","bookNameLower":"la-ira-de-los-cuatro-herederos-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-05-05 12:00:01","firstShelfTime":"2026-05-05 12:00:01","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700691412","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/21/4x8/48x7/487x0/48701000024/700691412_1/700691412.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=atS-yCFT6B9wIqb3f5oUIXRvKdDi952pRWewjVa7hDgZVoIEejGRsexVMzrNPmHeWWkU84SwZS2US8nSuRd7Uc2ifeP1DKCMlaX4tkorKNaaED5Hrw6mO5JzD~WfzikmeERs91vHDsuQt1jFHudhZC6tAuau51Z641msWTVWqDN52Rs5EtxfJeWA7Im9fywXZNfwTHHx1HN5ot9vdnVLNXi5UNK36eoPZ9wpLHJIKfRMA~RUSxbr~osteI3SaKgwiYlL-Gd6W8bOmPFNEcdewkkvpHQXB2DZJ7nnyinBFNnx7ajcvQES-322EaZYyYOT5ZeNuwT~rDwTejDtaYIsAQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/21/4x8/48x7/487x0/48701000024/700691412_1/700691412.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":227337,"price":0},{"id":"700691413","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.c